This directory is a FIXTURE, not a showcase piece. It exists so a contributor
can see the exact shape of a case contribution — the config, the source-bound
receipt, the record — and copy it. The no-derivatives term on the rest of
examples/ would contradict that, so this fixture is carved out: copy it,
adapt it, use it however you like.

The other example families in examples/ are finished designs and stay
CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0. See ../../LICENSES.md.
